        "<code>p-&gt;roll</code> is exactly the same as <code>(*p).roll</code>.",
        "The brackets in <code>(*p).roll</code> are compulsory — <code>.</code> has higher precedence than <code>*</code>.",
        "A <strong>self-referential structure</strong> holds a pointer to its own type: <code>struct Node *next;</code>.",
        "It must be a <strong>pointer</strong> to its own type — a plain <code>struct Node next;</code> would be infinite in size.",
